        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rod Lurie, Douchan Gersi, James Coburn\n- Works: Deterrence, Explore\n- Topics: Film, television, documentary filmmaking, criticism, nuclear brinkmanship\n\nFacts:\n- Douchan Gersi was born in 1947 and died in 2015.\n- Rod Lurie was born on May 15, 1962.\n- Rod Lurie is an Israeli-American director, screenwriter, and former film critic.\n- Deterrence is a 1999 French-American dramatic film written and directed by Rod Lurie.\n- Deterrence depicts fictional events about nuclear brinkmanship.\n- Douchan Gersi was a Slovak-born, Belgium-raised, Bali-based adventurer, documentary filmmaker, author, and actor.\n- Douchan Gersi was the producer and star of Explore, a PBS mini-series, with actor James Coburn.",
